"identitat de l'operador i per preomplir el formulari de reserva sense QR."
" Identificador personal regulat per l'AEAT segons la llei tributària "
"espanyola; tipat com a SecretStr per evitar-ne la filtració a través de "
"repr / model_dump / ValidationError."

#: ../../reference/environment-overrides.md
msgid "`CADRUMO_CLAVE_MOVIL_NIE_SOPORTE`"
msgstr "`CADRUMO_CLAVE_MOVIL_NIE_SOPORTE`"

#: ../../reference/environment-overrides.md
msgid ""
"NIE support number (número de soporte) used by the non-QR Cl@ve Móvil "
"fallback form. Applies when the configured identity is a NIE. AEAT-"
"regulated personal identifier; typed as SecretStr to prevent leakage."
msgstr ""
"Número de suport del NIE (número de soporte) que utilitza el formulari de"
" reserva sense QR de Cl@ve Móvil. S'aplica quan la identitat configurada "
"és un NIE. Identificador personal regulat per l'AEAT; tipat com a "
"SecretStr per evitar-ne la filtració."

#: ../../reference/environment-overrides.md
msgid "`CADRUMO_CLAVE_MOVIL_TIMEOUT_MS`"
msgstr "`CADRUMO_CLAVE_MOVIL_TIMEOUT_MS`"

#: ../../reference/environment-overrides.md
msgid "`120000`"
msgstr "`120000`"

#: ../../reference/environment-overrides.md
msgid ""
"Maximum time (milliseconds) the Cl@ve Móvil provider waits for AEAT "
"browser-side authentication completion before aborting. Production runs "
"must fail fast enough for an operator to retry deliberately rather than "
"leaving a pending request dangling."
msgstr ""
"Temps màxim (mil·lisegons) que el proveïdor de Cl@ve Móvil espera que es "
"completi l'autenticació del costat del navegador de l'AEAT abans "
"d'avortar. Les execucions de producció han de fallar prou de pressa "
"perquè un operador pugui reintentar deliberadament en comptes de deixar "
"una sol·licitud pendent penjada."

#: ../../reference/environment-overrides.md
msgid "`CADRUMO_CLAVE_PERMANENTE_DNI_NIE`"
msgstr "`CADRUMO_CLAVE_PERMANENTE_DNI_NIE`"

#: ../../reference/environment-overrides.md
msgid ""
"Taxpayer DNI/NIE for `aeat config auth configure --provider "
"clave_permanente`. Used as the Cl@ve IdP login username and to stamp the "
"persisted session with the operator's identity. AEAT-regulated personal "
"identifier under Spanish tax law; typed as SecretStr to prevent leakage "
"through repr / model_dump / ValidationError."
msgstr ""
"DNI/NIE del contribuent per a `aeat config auth configure --provider "
"clave_permanente`. S'utilitza com a nom d'usuari d'inici de sessió a "
"l'IdP de Cl@ve i per segellar la sessió persistida amb la identitat de "
"l'operador. Identificador personal regulat per l'AEAT segons la llei "
"tributària espanyola; tipat com a SecretStr per evitar-ne la filtració a "
"través de repr / model_dump / ValidationError."

#: ../../reference/environment-overrides.md
msgid "`CADRUMO_CLAVE_PERMANENTE_PASSWORD`"
msgstr "`CADRUMO_CLAVE_PERMANENTE_PASSWORD`"

#: ../../reference/environment-overrides.md
msgid ""
"Cl@ve Permanente password for the DNI/NIE + password login form. Same "
"treatment as the certificate passphrase: env var only, never stored in a "
"committed env file, never logged."
msgstr ""
"Contrasenya de Cl@ve Permanente per al formulari d'inici de sessió "
"DNI/NIE + contrasenya. Mateix tractament que la contrasenya del "
"certificat: només variable d'entorn, mai emmagatzemada en un fitxer "
"d'entorn comès, mai registrada."

#: ../../reference/environment-overrides.md
msgid "`CADRUMO_CLAVE_PERMANENTE_TIMEOUT_MS`"
msgstr "`CADRUMO_CLAVE_PERMANENTE_TIMEOUT_MS`"

#: ../../reference/environment-overrides.md
msgid "`60000`"
msgstr "`60000`"

#: ../../reference/environment-overrides.md
msgid ""
"Maximum time (milliseconds) the Cl@ve Permanente provider waits for the "
"AEAT/Cl@ve IdP login form round-trip to complete before aborting. Routine"
" Cl@ve Permanente login is headless-automatable (DNI/NIE + password, no "
"SMS), so this window is shorter than the human-in-the-loop Cl@ve Móvil "
"timeout."
msgstr ""
"Temps màxim (mil·lisegons) que el proveïdor de Cl@ve Permanente espera "
"que es completi l'anada i tornada del formulari d'inici de sessió de "
"l'IdP de l'AEAT/Cl@ve abans d'avortar. L'inici de sessió rutinari de "
"Cl@ve Permanente es pot automatitzar sense capçalera (DNI/NIE + "
"contrasenya, sense SMS), de manera que aquesta finestra és més curta que "
"el temps màxim de Cl@ve Móvil amb intervenció humana."

#: ../../reference/environment-overrides.md
msgid "`CADRUMO_CLAVE_PREFER_NON_QR`"
msgstr "`CADRUMO_CLAVE_PREFER_NON_QR`"

#: ../../reference/environment-overrides.md
msgid "`false`"
msgstr "`false`"

#: ../../reference/environment-overrides.md
msgid ""
"When true, the Cl@ve Móvil provider uses the non-QR fallback (DNI/NIE + "
"contraste) rather than the QR code. This still requires operator-mediated"
" completion in Cl@ve."
msgstr ""
"Quan és cert, el proveïdor de Cl@ve Móvil utilitza la reserva sense QR "
"(DNI/NIE + contraste) en comptes del codi QR. Això encara requereix que "
"l'operador completi el procés a Cl@ve."

#: ../../reference/environment-overrides.md
msgid "`CADRUMO_CLI_REVEAL_IDENTIFIERS`"
msgstr "`CADRUMO_CLI_REVEAL_IDENTIFIERS`"

#: ../../reference/environment-overrides.md
msgid ""
"Reveal raw profile and bucket identifiers in CLI success output instead "
"of the paste-safe ``<profile-id>`` / ``<bucket-id>`` placeholders. "
"Default off keeps the centralised-output-redaction policy (profile/bucket"
" UUIDs are redacted so diagnostics are safe to paste into shared notes). "
"A multi-client gestor who must disambiguate which bucket a command "
"addressed sets ``CADRUMO_CLI_REVEAL_IDENTIFIERS=1`` to opt out. This only"
" un-redacts the opaque profile/bucket UUIDs; NIF/NIE/CIF tax identities, "
"bearer tokens, URLs, and secure-object keys stay redacted "
"unconditionally."
msgstr ""
"Mostra els identificadors de perfil i de bucket en brut a la sortida "
"d'èxit de la CLI en comptes dels marcadors segurs per enganxar "
"``<profile-id>`` / ``<bucket-id>``. Desactivat per defecte, manté la "
"política de redacció centralitzada de la sortida (els UUID de "
"perfil/bucket es redacten perquè els diagnòstics es puguin enganxar amb "
"seguretat en notes compartides). Un gestor amb múltiples clients que hagi"
" de desambiguar a quin bucket es va adreçar una ordre estableix "
"``CADRUMO_CLI_REVEAL_IDENTIFIERS=1`` per excloure-se'n. Això només "
"desredacta els UUID opacs de perfil/bucket; les identitats fiscals "
"NIF/NIE/CIF, els testimonis de portador, les URL i les claus d'objectes "
"segurs es mantenen redactades incondicionalment."

#: ../../reference/environment-overrides.md
msgid "`CADRUMO_CORPUS_TEXT_CACHE_DIR`"
msgstr "`CADRUMO_CORPUS_TEXT_CACHE_DIR`"

#: ../../reference/environment-overrides.md
msgid ""
"Directory for the registry corpus source-text validation cache "
"(normalised text keyed by content fingerprint)"
msgstr ""
"Directori de la memòria cau de validació del text d'origen del corpus del"
" registre (text normalitzat indexat per empremta de contingut)"

#: ../../reference/environment-overrides.md
msgid "`CADRUMO_DATABASE_URL`"
msgstr "`CADRUMO_DATABASE_URL`"

#: ../../reference/environment-overrides.md
msgid ""
"SQLAlchemy URL for the primary persistence backend. When empty, the model"
" validator resolves the URL through the active-profile precedence chain "
"to ``sqlite:///<cadrumo_local_storage_root>/buckets/<bucket-"
"id>/db/cadrumo.db``; with no active profile it derives a root-level "
"fallback at ``sqlite:///<cadrumo_local_storage_root>/cadrumo.db`` so the "
"URL is never empty when the storage root is set. Tests that need a "
"deterministic location supply this field explicitly; production reads the"
" computed value."
msgstr ""
"URL de SQLAlchemy per al backend de persistència principal. Quan és "
"buida, el validador del model resol la URL a través de la cadena de "
"precedència del perfil actiu cap a "
"``sqlite:///<cadrumo_local_storage_root>/buckets/<bucket-"
"id>/db/cadrumo.db``; sense cap perfil actiu, en deriva una de reserva a "
"nivell d'arrel a ``sqlite:///<cadrumo_local_storage_root>/cadrumo.db`` de"
" manera que la URL mai no és buida quan l'arrel d'emmagatzematge està "
"definida. Les proves que necessiten una ubicació determinista "
"proporcionen aquest camp explícitament; la producció llegeix el valor "
"calculat."

#: ../../reference/environment-overrides.md
msgid "`CADRUMO_DEADLINE_DUE_SOON_DAYS`"
msgstr "`CADRUMO_DEADLINE_DUE_SOON_DAYS`"

#: ../../reference/environment-overrides.md
msgid ""
"Days before an obligation's closes_on date that flag "
"ObligationStatus.DUE_SOON in the deadline engine"
msgstr ""
"Dies abans de la data closes_on d'una obligació que marquen "
"ObligationStatus.DUE_SOON al motor de terminis"

#: ../../reference/environment-overrides.md
msgid "`CADRUMO_DEV_TEST_DATABASE_PASSWORD`"
msgstr "`CADRUMO_DEV_TEST_DATABASE_PASSWORD`"

#: ../../reference/environment-overrides.md
msgid "Development/test-only password used by secure-storage subprocess tests."
msgstr ""
"Contrasenya només per a desenvolupament/proves que utilitzen les proves "
"de subprocés d'emmagatzematge segur."

#: ../../reference/environment-overrides.md
msgid "`CADRUMO_DRAFT_FAIL_ON_WARNING`"
msgstr "`CADRUMO_DRAFT_FAIL_ON_WARNING`"

#: ../../reference/environment-overrides.md
msgid ""
"If true, build_draft raises FilingValidationError when any WARNING- or "
"ERROR-severity finding is produced"
msgstr ""
"Si és cert, build_draft llança FilingValidationError quan es produeix "
"qualsevol troballa de gravetat WARNING o ERROR"

#: ../../reference/environment-overrides.md
msgid "`CADRUMO_DRAFTS_DIR`"
msgstr "`CADRUMO_DRAFTS_DIR`"

#: ../../reference/environment-overrides.md
msgid "Directory where filing drafts are written as JSON files"
msgstr "Directori on els esborranys de presentació s'escriuen com a fitxers JSON"

#: ../../reference/environment-overrides.md
msgid "`CADRUMO_EVIDENCE_CLOUD_UPLOAD_PERMITTED`"
msgstr "`CADRUMO_EVIDENCE_CLOUD_UPLOAD_PERMITTED`"

#: ../../reference/environment-overrides.md
msgid ""
"Whether this deployment permits transmitting evidence to a cloud model at"
" all. Default off: evidence reading is on-host only. When True, a per-"
"invocation operator consent acknowledgement is still required for each "
"cloud read."
msgstr ""
"Si aquest desplegament permet transmetre evidència a un model al núvol o "
"no. Desactivat per defecte: la lectura d'evidència només es fa a "
"l'amfitrió. Quan és True, encara cal un reconeixement de consentiment de "
"l'operador per invocació per a cada lectura al núvol."

#: ../../reference/environment-overrides.md
msgid "`CADRUMO_EVIDENCE_GESTOR_MODE`"
msgstr "`CADRUMO_EVIDENCE_GESTOR_MODE`"

#: ../../reference/environment-overrides.md
msgid ""
"Gestor/professional deployment flag. When True, cloud evidence upload is "
"categorically refused regardless of "
"cadrumo_evidence_cloud_upload_permitted or per-invocation consent."
msgstr ""
"Indicador de desplegament per a gestor/professional. Quan és True, la "
"pujada d'evidència al núvol es refusa categòricament independentment de "
"cadrumo_evidence_cloud_upload_permitted o del consentiment per invocació."

#: ../../reference/environment-overrides.md
msgid "`CADRUMO_FALLBACK_LANGUAGES`"
msgstr "`CADRUMO_FALLBACK_LANGUAGES`"

#: ../../reference/environment-overrides.md
msgid "`es,en`"
msgstr "`es,en`"

#: ../../reference/environment-overrides.md
msgid ""
"Comma-separated fallback chain consulted when the target language is "
"missing."
msgstr ""
"Cadena de reserva separada per comes que es consulta quan falta la "
"llengua de destinació."

#: ../../reference/environment-overrides.md
msgid "`CADRUMO_FILE_LOCK_RETRY_BACKOFF_S`"
msgstr "`CADRUMO_FILE_LOCK_RETRY_BACKOFF_S`"

#: ../../reference/environment-overrides.md
msgid "`0.05`"
msgstr "`0.05`"

#: ../../reference/environment-overrides.md
msgid "Sleep interval (seconds) between non-blocking file-lock acquire attempts"
msgstr ""
"Interval d'espera (segons) entre intents no bloquejants d'adquisició del "
"bloqueig de fitxer"

#: ../../reference/environment-overrides.md
msgid "`CADRUMO_FILE_LOCK_TIMEOUT_S`"
msgstr "`CADRUMO_FILE_LOCK_TIMEOUT_S`"

#: ../../reference/environment-overrides.md
msgid "`30.0`"
msgstr "`30.0`"

#: ../../reference/environment-overrides.md
msgid "Default exclusive file-lock acquisition timeout (seconds)"
msgstr ""
"Temps màxim per defecte d'adquisició del bloqueig exclusiu de fitxer "
"(segons)"

#: ../../reference/environment-overrides.md
msgid "`CADRUMO_FILING_HISTORY_ARCHIVE_HTML`"
msgstr "`CADRUMO_FILING_HISTORY_ARCHIVE_HTML`"

#: ../../reference/environment-overrides.md
msgid ""
"If true, archive fetched detail-page HTML under "
"<cadrumo_filing_history_dir>/pages/"
msgstr ""
"Si és cert, arxiva l'HTML de les pàgines de detall obtingudes sota "
"<cadrumo_filing_history_dir>/pages/"

#: ../../reference/environment-overrides.md
msgid "`CADRUMO_FILING_HISTORY_CACHE_TTL_S`"
msgstr "`CADRUMO_FILING_HISTORY_CACHE_TTL_S`"

#: ../../reference/environment-overrides.md
msgid ""
"TTL in seconds for per-expediente filing-history cache entries (default "
"15 min)"
msgstr ""
"TTL en segons per a les entrades de la memòria cau de l'historial de "
"presentacions per expedient (per defecte 15 min)"

#: ../../reference/environment-overrides.md
msgid "`CADRUMO_FILING_HISTORY_DIR`"
msgstr "`CADRUMO_FILING_HISTORY_DIR`"

#: ../../reference/environment-overrides.md
msgid "Directory where the persisted ModeloHistory JSON file lives"
msgstr "Directori on es troba el fitxer JSON persistit de ModeloHistory"

#: ../../reference/environment-overrides.md
msgid "`CADRUMO_FINANCIAL_TXS_DIR`"
msgstr "`CADRUMO_FINANCIAL_TXS_DIR`"

#: ../../reference/environment-overrides.md
msgid "Directory where the transaction catalogue JSON file is stored"
msgstr "Directori on es desa el fitxer JSON del catàleg de transaccions"

#: ../../reference/environment-overrides.md
msgid "`CADRUMO_FORCE_COLOR`"
msgstr "`CADRUMO_FORCE_COLOR`"

#: ../../reference/environment-overrides.md
msgid ""
"Force ANSI colour output even when stdout is not a TTY. Operators set "
"this when piping Cadrumo output through a terminal renderer (less -R, gh "
"actions, etc.). Defaults to False; the should_use_color() helper consults"
" this and the standard NO_COLOR convention through Settings rather than "
"reading os.environ directly."
msgstr ""
"Força la sortida de color ANSI fins i tot quan stdout no és un TTY. Els "
"operadors ho estableixen quan canalitzen la sortida de Cadrumo a través "
"d'un renderitzador de terminal (less -R, gh actions, etc.). Per defecte "
"és False; l'ajudant should_use_color() consulta aquest valor i la "
"convenció estàndard NO_COLOR a través de Settings en comptes de llegir "
"os.environ directament."

#: ../../reference/environment-overrides.md
msgid "`CADRUMO_FX_RATE_LOOKUP_TIMEOUT_S`"
msgstr "`CADRUMO_FX_RATE_LOOKUP_TIMEOUT_S`"

#: ../../reference/environment-overrides.md
msgid ""
"Timeout (seconds) for one ECB Data Portal euro reference-rate lookup. A "
"ledger import resolves one lookup per distinct currency/date, so this "
"budget bounds a single observation query rather than the whole import."
msgstr ""
"Temps d'espera (segons) per a una consulta del tipus de canvi de "
"referència de l'euro a l'ECB Data Portal. Una importació del ledger resol"
" una consulta per cada combinació distinta de divisa i data, de manera "
"que aquest pressupost acota una única consulta d'observació, no la "
"importació completa."

#: ../../reference/environment-overrides.md
msgid "`CADRUMO_GOOGLE_DRIVE_ROOT_FOLDER_ID`"
msgstr "`CADRUMO_GOOGLE_DRIVE_ROOT_FOLDER_ID`"

#: ../../reference/environment-overrides.md
msgid ""
"Drive folder ID under which `cadrumo-vault/` is created and used. "
"Required when cadrumo_storage_provider_kind=google_drive. Operator "
"obtains this from the Cloud Console / Drive web UI; the app creates "
"`cadrumo-vault/` lazily on first probe."
msgstr ""
"ID de la carpeta de Drive sota la qual es crea i s'utilitza `cadrumo-"
"vault/`. Necessari quan cadrumo_storage_provider_kind=google_drive. "
"L'operador l'obté de la Cloud Console / la interfície web de Drive; "
"l'aplicació crea `cadrumo-vault/` de manera diferida en el primer "
"sondeig."

#: ../../reference/environment-overrides.md
msgid "`CADRUMO_GOOGLE_DRIVE_VAULT_FOLDER_NAME`"
msgstr "`CADRUMO_GOOGLE_DRIVE_VAULT_FOLDER_NAME`"

#: ../../reference/environment-overrides.md
msgid "`cadrumo-vault`"
msgstr "`cadrumo-vault`"

#: ../../reference/environment-overrides.md
msgid "Folder name created under the Google Drive root for the Cadrumo vault"
msgstr ""
"Nom de carpeta creada sota l'arrel de Google Drive per a la caixa forta "
"de Cadrumo"

#: ../../reference/environment-overrides.md
msgid "`CADRUMO_GOOGLE_OAUTH_ACCESS_REFRESH_BUFFER_S`"
msgstr "`CADRUMO_GOOGLE_OAUTH_ACCESS_REFRESH_BUFFER_S`"

#: ../../reference/environment-overrides.md
msgid "`300`"
msgstr "`300`"

#: ../../reference/environment-overrides.md
msgid ""
"Clock-skew buffer (seconds) before nominal expiry when refreshing Google "
"access tokens"
msgstr ""
"Marge de desviació del rellotge (segons) abans de la caducitat nominal en"
" refrescar els testimonis d'accés de Google"

#: ../../reference/environment-overrides.md
msgid "`CADRUMO_INBOX_ALERT_LEAD_DAYS`"
msgstr "`CADRUMO_INBOX_ALERT_LEAD_DAYS`"

#: ../../reference/environment-overrides.md
msgid "`7`"
msgstr "`7`"

#: ../../reference/environment-overrides.md
msgid ""
"Lead window (days) for notification deadline reporting: surface "
"CRITICAL/HIGH notifications whose appeal_deadline falls within the next N"
" days"
msgstr ""
"Finestra d'antelació (dies) per a l'informe de terminis de notificacions:"
" mostra les notificacions CRITICAL/HIGH la appeal_deadline de les quals "
"cau dins dels pròxims N dies"

#: ../../reference/environment-overrides.md
msgid "`CADRUMO_INBOX_DIR`"
msgstr "`CADRUMO_INBOX_DIR`"

#: ../../reference/environment-overrides.md
msgid "Directory where the persisted Inbox JSON file lives"
msgstr "Directori on es troba el fitxer JSON persistit de la Bústia"

#: ../../reference/environment-overrides.md
msgid "`CADRUMO_INBOX_PDF_DIR`"
msgstr "`CADRUMO_INBOX_PDF_DIR`"

#: ../../reference/environment-overrides.md
msgid "Directory where downloaded notification PDFs are stored"
msgstr "Directori on es desen els PDF de notificacions baixats"

#: ../../reference/environment-overrides.md
msgid "`CADRUMO_INVOICES_DIR`"
msgstr "`CADRUMO_INVOICES_DIR`"

#: ../../reference/environment-overrides.md
msgid "Directory where the invoice catalogue JSON file is stored"
msgstr "Directori on es desa el fitxer JSON del catàleg de factures"

#: ../../reference/environment-overrides.md
msgid "`CADRUMO_IVA_CATALOGUE_ROOT`"
msgstr "`CADRUMO_IVA_CATALOGUE_ROOT`"

#: ../../reference/environment-overrides.md
msgid "Root directory for the hand-reviewed IVA taxonomy catalogue"
msgstr "Directori arrel del catàleg de taxonomia d'IVA revisat a mà"

#: ../../reference/environment-overrides.md
msgid "`CADRUMO_JUSTIFICANTE_PARSER_BACKEND`"
msgstr "`CADRUMO_JUSTIFICANTE_PARSER_BACKEND`"

#: ../../reference/environment-overrides.md
msgid "JustificanteParserBackendSetting"
msgstr "JustificanteParserBackendSetting"

#: ../../reference/environment-overrides.md
