msgstr "`pdfplumber`"

#: ../../reference/environment-overrides.md
msgid "Parser backend for `cadrumo.adapters.inbound.justificante`"
msgstr "Backend d'anàlisi per a `cadrumo.adapters.inbound.justificante`"

#: ../../reference/environment-overrides.md
msgid "`CADRUMO_JUSTIFICANTES_DIR`"
msgstr "`CADRUMO_JUSTIFICANTES_DIR`"

#: ../../reference/environment-overrides.md
msgid "Directory where parsed justificante PDFs and metadata are stored"
msgstr ""
"Directori on es desen els PDF de justificants analitzats i les seves "
"metadades"

#: ../../reference/environment-overrides.md
#, fuzzy
msgid "`CADRUMO_KEYRING_PROBE_TIMEOUT_S`"
msgstr "`CADRUMO_CLAVE_PERMANENTE_TIMEOUT_MS`"

#: ../../reference/environment-overrides.md
#, fuzzy
msgid "`10.0`"
msgstr "`180.0`"

#: ../../reference/environment-overrides.md
msgid ""
"Wall-clock budget (seconds) for the AUTO backend's OS-keychain read "
"before it is treated as locked. macOS Keychain ACLs are per-binary, so a "
"process distinct from the one that minted the item must answer an "
