"show, and the read would otherwise block forever. Generous enough that a "
"foreground operator can answer the prompt; short enough that a dialog-"
"less context degrades promptly instead of hanging"
msgstr ""

#: ../../reference/environment-overrides.md
msgid "`CADRUMO_LIBREOFFICE_EXECUTABLE`"
msgstr "`CADRUMO_LIBREOFFICE_EXECUTABLE`"

#: ../../reference/environment-overrides.md
msgid ""
"Optional explicit path to the soffice / libreoffice binary used by the "
"workbook-parity scanner. When None the scanner resolves it from PATH."
msgstr ""
"Ruta explícita opcional al binari soffice / libreoffice que utilitza "
"l'escàner de paritat de llibres de treball. Quan és None, l'escàner la "
"resol des de PATH."

#: ../../reference/environment-overrides.md
msgid "`CADRUMO_LIVE_FILED_REGISTER_WALK_TIMEOUT_MS`"
msgstr "`CADRUMO_LIVE_FILED_REGISTER_WALK_TIMEOUT_MS`"

#: ../../reference/environment-overrides.md
msgid ""
"Timeout (ms) for one AEAT filed-declaration register query for a single "
"modelo/year. Bulk filed-history reads use this per-query budget so one "
"slow modelo cannot block all later modelos from returning typed failures."
msgstr ""
"Temps màxim (ms) per a una consulta al registre de declaracions "
"presentades de l'AEAT per a un sol model/any. Les lectures massives de "
"l'historial de presentacions utilitzen aquest pressupost per consulta de "
"manera que un model lent no pugui impedir que tots els models posteriors "
"retornin fallades tipades."

#: ../../reference/environment-overrides.md
msgid "`CADRUMO_LIVE_IVA_CANCELLATION_DRAIN_MS`"
msgstr "`CADRUMO_LIVE_IVA_CANCELLATION_DRAIN_MS`"

#: ../../reference/environment-overrides.md
msgid "`250`"
msgstr "`250`"

#: ../../reference/environment-overrides.md
msgid ""
"Drain delay (ms) after a bounded live IVA read surface is cancelled, "
"giving Playwright browser tasks time to report cancellation-only errors "
"before the loop handler is restored."
msgstr ""
"Retard de drenatge (ms) després que es cancel·li una superfície de "
"lectura en directe d'IVA acotada, donant a les tasques del navegador de "
"Playwright temps per informar d'errors de només cancel·lació abans de "
"restaurar el gestor del bucle."

#: ../../reference/environment-overrides.md
msgid "`CADRUMO_LIVE_IVA_CLI_WATCHDOG_TIMEOUT_MS`"
msgstr "`CADRUMO_LIVE_IVA_CLI_WATCHDOG_TIMEOUT_MS`"

#: ../../reference/environment-overrides.md
msgid "`240000`"
msgstr "`240000`"

#: ../../reference/environment-overrides.md
msgid ""
"Top-level CLI watchdog timeout (ms) for the combined read-only IVA "
"remote-state command. This must exceed the normal auth and surface "
"budgets but remain below operator shell/tool timeouts so the CLI can "
"cancel and clean up inside its own process."
msgstr ""
