#: ../../reference/environment-overrides.md
msgid "`CADRUMO_MCP_SERVING_CONCURRENCY`"
msgstr "`CADRUMO_MCP_SERVING_CONCURRENCY`"

#: ../../reference/environment-overrides.md
msgid "`4`"
msgstr "`4`"

#: ../../reference/environment-overrides.md
msgid ""
"Maximum MCP tool calls dispatched off the event loop at once. Bounds the "
"supervised subprocess spawn and the warm in-process worker pool so a "
"burst cannot thrash the host; the previous anyio default admitted 40. A "
"conservative small default suits the single-operator desktop client; "
"raise it for a multi-client host."
msgstr ""
"Nombre màxim de crides d'eina MCP despatxades fora del bucle "
"d'esdeveniments alhora. Acota la creació de subprocessos supervisats i el"
" conjunt de treballadors en procés en calent perquè una ràfega no pugui "
"saturar l'amfitrió; el valor per defecte anterior d'anyio n'admetia 40. "
"Un valor per defecte petit i conservador s'adiu amb el client "
"d'escriptori d'un sol operador; augmenta'l per a un amfitrió multiclient."

#: ../../reference/environment-overrides.md
#, fuzzy
msgid "`CADRUMO_MCP_STDIO_WATCHDOG`"
msgstr "`CADRUMO_SECRET_STORE_BACKEND`"

#: ../../reference/environment-overrides.md
msgid ""
"Whether the MCP stdio server anchors its lifetime to the client process. "
"The stdio contract is 'exit on stdin EOF', but on Windows an inherited "
"pipe handle can keep stdin open after the spawning client is gone, so EOF"
" never arrives and the server runs indefinitely - holding its warm caches"
" and never running the interpreter-exit hooks that zeroise bound bucket "
"sessions. The watchdog reaps the server when its client dies. Disable "
"only to diagnose the watchdog itself: with it off, stdin EOF is the sole "
"exit path and a leaked server is unreapable."
msgstr ""

#: ../../reference/environment-overrides.md
msgid "`CADRUMO_MCP_WARM_CAPTURE_WAIT_SECONDS`"
msgstr "`CADRUMO_MCP_WARM_CAPTURE_WAIT_SECONDS`"

#: ../../reference/environment-overrides.md
msgid "`5.0`"
msgstr "`5.0`"

#: ../../reference/environment-overrides.md
msgid ""
"How long a warm in-process MCP call waits for the stdout-capture lock "
"before degrading to the supervised subprocess transport. Bounds the blast"
" radius of a slow or hung in-process verb: a call never queues forever "
"behind the capture. Comfortably covers a normal warm call's sub-second-"
"to-low-single-digit hold."
msgstr ""
"Quant de temps una crida MCP en procés en calent espera el bloqueig de "
"captura de stdout abans de degradar-se al transport de subprocés "
"supervisat. Acota el radi d'impacte d'un verb en procés lent o penjat: "
"una crida no s'encua mai indefinidament darrere de la captura. Cobreix "
"folgadament la retenció d'una crida en calent normal, de menys d'un segon"
" a uns pocs segons."

#: ../../reference/environment-overrides.md
msgid "`CADRUMO_MCP_WEDGE_THRESHOLD_SECONDS`"
msgstr "`CADRUMO_MCP_WEDGE_THRESHOLD_SECONDS`"

#: ../../reference/environment-overrides.md
msgid "`180.0`"
msgstr "`180.0`"

#: ../../reference/environment-overrides.md
msgid ""
"When a warm in-process call has held the stdout-capture lock past this "
"many seconds the warm transport is declared wedged and subsequent "
"READ/MUTATE calls route straight to the supervised subprocess (a warning "
"Notice names the wedge) until the wedged worker completes. Defaults to "
"the MUTATE tier ceiling, the longest an in-process call may legitimately "
"run."
msgstr ""
"Quan una crida en procés en calent ha retingut el bloqueig de captura de "
"stdout més enllà d'aquest nombre de segons, el transport en calent es "
"declara encallat i les crides READ/MUTATE següents s'encaminen "
"directament al subprocés supervisat (un Notice d'advertència identifica "
"l'encallament) fins que el treballador encallat acaba. Per defecte pren "
"el sostre del nivell MUTATE, el màxim que una crida en procés pot "
"executar-se legítimament."

#: ../../reference/environment-overrides.md
msgid "`CADRUMO_OUTPUT_LANGUAGE`"
msgstr "`CADRUMO_OUTPUT_LANGUAGE`"

#: ../../reference/environment-overrides.md
msgid "OutputLanguage"
msgstr "OutputLanguage"

#: ../../reference/environment-overrides.md
msgid ""
"Target ISO 639-1 language code for user-facing content. Invalid values "
"coerce to None and fall back to the default."
msgstr ""
"Codi de llengua ISO 639-1 de destinació per al contingut de cara a "
"l'usuari. Els valors no vàlids es converteixen a None i recorren al valor"
" per defecte."

#: ../../reference/environment-overrides.md
msgid "`CADRUMO_PROXY_BYPASS`"
msgstr "`CADRUMO_PROXY_BYPASS`"

#: ../../reference/environment-overrides.md
msgid "Comma-separated list of domains to bypass the proxy"
msgstr "Llista separada per comes de dominis que han d'ometre el proxy"

#: ../../reference/environment-overrides.md
msgid "`CADRUMO_PROXY_PASSWORD_SECRET`"
msgstr "`CADRUMO_PROXY_PASSWORD_SECRET`"

#: ../../reference/environment-overrides.md
msgid "Password for proxy authentication"
msgstr "Contrasenya per a l'autenticació del proxy"

#: ../../reference/environment-overrides.md
msgid "`CADRUMO_PROXY_URL`"
msgstr "`CADRUMO_PROXY_URL`"

#: ../../reference/environment-overrides.md
msgid "Proxy URL (e.g., 'http://proxy.example.com:8080')"
msgstr "URL del proxy (p. ex., «http://proxy.example.com:8080»)"

#: ../../reference/environment-overrides.md
msgid "`CADRUMO_PROXY_USERNAME`"
msgstr "`CADRUMO_PROXY_USERNAME`"

#: ../../reference/environment-overrides.md
msgid "Username for proxy authentication"
msgstr "Nom d'usuari per a l'autenticació del proxy"

#: ../../reference/environment-overrides.md
msgid "`CADRUMO_RATE_LIMIT_DELAY_SECONDS`"
msgstr "`CADRUMO_RATE_LIMIT_DELAY_SECONDS`"

#: ../../reference/environment-overrides.md
msgid "Minimum delay between AEAT requests in seconds"
msgstr "Retard mínim entre sol·licituds a l'AEAT, en segons"

#: ../../reference/environment-overrides.md
msgid "`CADRUMO_REGISTRY_DISK_CACHE_DIR`"
msgstr "`CADRUMO_REGISTRY_DISK_CACHE_DIR`"

#: ../../reference/environment-overrides.md
msgid ""
"Override for the cross-process registry disk-pickle directory. When "
"unset, production derives <cadrumo_local_storage_root>/cache/registry and"
" pytest runs share the host temp directory for the immutable bundled-root"
" pickle. Set only by test isolation to redirect the cache onto a test-"
"owned directory, so a test asserting exclusive pickle state never races "
"sibling pytest-xdist workers."
msgstr ""
"Substitució del directori de pickle a disc del registre entre processos. "
"Quan no es defineix, la producció deriva "
"<cadrumo_local_storage_root>/cache/registry i les execucions de pytest "
"comparteixen el directori temporal de l'amfitrió per al pickle immutable "
"d'arrel inclosa. L'estableix només l'aïllament de proves per redirigir la"
" memòria cau cap a un directori propietat de la prova, de manera que una "
"prova que afirma un estat de pickle exclusiu mai no competeixi amb els "
"treballadors germans de pytest-xdist."

#: ../../reference/environment-overrides.md
msgid "`CADRUMO_REGISTRY_DISK_CACHE_MAX_ENTRIES`"
msgstr "`CADRUMO_REGISTRY_DISK_CACHE_MAX_ENTRIES`"

#: ../../reference/environment-overrides.md
msgid "`8`"
msgstr "`8`"

#: ../../reference/environment-overrides.md
msgid ""
"Maximum number of registry disk-cache pickles retained per cache "
"directory; after each write the oldest excess pickles are pruned (best-"
"effort) so accumulated per-fingerprint pickles cannot grow without bound."
msgstr ""
"Nombre màxim de pickles de memòria cau a disc del registre que es "
"conserven per directori de memòria cau; després de cada escriptura, els "
"pickles sobrants més antics s'eliminen (amb el millor esforç) de manera "
"que els pickles acumulats per empremta no puguin créixer sense límit."

#: ../../reference/environment-overrides.md
msgid "`CADRUMO_REGISTRY_PARITY_STORE_DIR`"
msgstr "`CADRUMO_REGISTRY_PARITY_STORE_DIR`"

#: ../../reference/environment-overrides.md
msgid "Directory where registry parity tape artifacts are archived by default"
msgstr ""
"Directori on s'arxiven per defecte els artefactes de cinta de paritat del"
" registre"

#: ../../reference/environment-overrides.md
msgid "`CADRUMO_REPLAY_ACTIVE`"
msgstr "`CADRUMO_REPLAY_ACTIVE`"

#: ../../reference/environment-overrides.md
msgid ""
"Subprocess-IPC marker carrying the original run_id when a CLI invocation "
"is a replay re-entry"
msgstr ""
"Marcador d'IPC de subprocés que porta el run_id original quan una "
"invocació de la CLI és una reentrada de reproducció"

#: ../../reference/environment-overrides.md
msgid "`CADRUMO_RUNS_DIR`"
msgstr "`CADRUMO_RUNS_DIR`"

#: ../../reference/environment-overrides.md
msgid ""
"Directory where run traces and JSONL event logs are persisted (one "
"subdirectory per run_id, containing trace.json + events.jsonl)"
msgstr ""
"Directori on es persisteixen els rastres d'execució i els registres "
"d'esdeveniments JSONL (un subdirectori per run_id, que conté trace.json +"
" events.jsonl)"

#: ../../reference/environment-overrides.md
msgid "`CADRUMO_RUNS_MAX_TOTAL_BYTES`"
msgstr "`CADRUMO_RUNS_MAX_TOTAL_BYTES`"

#: ../../reference/environment-overrides.md
msgid "`268435456`"
msgstr "`268435456`"

#: ../../reference/environment-overrides.md
msgid ""
"Trace-store byte cap; after age pruning, remove oldest runs but always "
"retain the newest"
msgstr ""
"Límit de bytes del magatzem de rastres; després de la poda per "
"antiguitat, elimina les execucions més antigues però conserva sempre la "
"més recent"

#: ../../reference/environment-overrides.md
msgid "`CADRUMO_RUNS_RETENTION_DAYS`"
msgstr "`CADRUMO_RUNS_RETENTION_DAYS`"

#: ../../reference/environment-overrides.md
msgid ""
"Retention window in days for per-run trace directories; older run "
"directories are pruned"
msgstr ""
"Finestra de retenció en dies per als directoris de rastres per execució; "
"els directoris d'execució més antics s'eliminen"

#: ../../reference/environment-overrides.md
msgid "`CADRUMO_SECRET_PASSPHRASE`"
msgstr "`CADRUMO_SECRET_PASSPHRASE`"

#: ../../reference/environment-overrides.md
msgid ""
"Passphrase that derives the encrypted-secret-store master key. Default "
"None — the master-key loader refuses operation on None or empty value to "
"preserve fail-closed behaviour. Operator-facing env var is "
"CADRUMO_SECRET_PASSPHRASE."
msgstr ""
"Contrasenya que deriva la clau mestra del magatzem de secrets xifrat. Per"
" defecte None: el carregador de la clau mestra refusa operar amb un valor"
" None o buit per preservar el comportament fail-closed. La variable "
"d'entorn de cara a l'operador és CADRUMO_SECRET_PASSPHRASE."

#: ../../reference/environment-overrides.md
msgid "`CADRUMO_SECRET_STORE_BACKEND`"
msgstr "`CADRUMO_SECRET_STORE_BACKEND`"

#: ../../reference/environment-overrides.md
msgid "SecretStoreBackend"
msgstr "SecretStoreBackend"

#: ../../reference/environment-overrides.md
msgid "`auto`"
msgstr "`auto`"

#: ../../reference/environment-overrides.md
msgid ""
"Master-key backend for the secret store. auto = OS keychain when "
"available, encrypted file fallback otherwise. keyring = OS keychain only "
"(refuses to fall back). file = encrypted file only (required for CI / "
"headless). unsecured = testing-only mode with a published deterministic "
"key; requires cadrumo_allow_unencrypted=true and refuses real NIFs."
msgstr ""
"Backend de la clau mestra per al magatzem de secrets. auto = clauer del "
"SO quan està disponible, amb reserva a fitxer xifrat altrament. keyring ="
" només clauer del SO (es nega a recórrer a la reserva). file = només "
"fitxer xifrat (necessari per a CI / sense capçalera). unsecured = mode "
"només de prova amb una clau determinista publicada; requereix "
"cadrumo_allow_unencrypted=true i refusa NIF reals."

#: ../../reference/environment-overrides.md
msgid "`CADRUMO_SECRET_STORE_DIR`"
msgstr "`CADRUMO_SECRET_STORE_DIR`"

#: ../../reference/environment-overrides.md
msgid ""
"Directory for the encrypted secret-store master-key file and ciphertext "
"records"
msgstr ""
"Directori per al fitxer de la clau mestra del magatzem de secrets xifrat "
"i els registres de text xifrat"

#: ../../reference/environment-overrides.md
msgid "`CADRUMO_STATUS_CACHE_DIR`"
msgstr "`CADRUMO_STATUS_CACHE_DIR`"

#: ../../reference/environment-overrides.md
msgid "Directory for the short-lived AEAT status-page cache"
msgstr ""
"Directori per a la memòria cau de curta durada de la pàgina d'estat de "
"l'AEAT"

#: ../../reference/environment-overrides.md
msgid "`CADRUMO_STATUS_CACHE_TTL_S`"
msgstr "`CADRUMO_STATUS_CACHE_TTL_S`"

#: ../../reference/environment-overrides.md
msgid "TTL in seconds for status cache entries (default 15 min)"
msgstr ""
"TTL en segons per a les entrades de la memòria cau d'estat (per defecte "
"15 min)"

#: ../../reference/environment-overrides.md
msgid "`CADRUMO_STORAGE_BACKUP_DIR`"
msgstr "`CADRUMO_STORAGE_BACKUP_DIR`"

#: ../../reference/environment-overrides.md
msgid "Directory where the storage layer writes database backups"
msgstr ""
"Directori on la capa d'emmagatzematge escriu les còpies de seguretat de "
"la base de dades"

#: ../../reference/environment-overrides.md
msgid "`CADRUMO_STORAGE_PROVIDER_KIND`"
msgstr "`CADRUMO_STORAGE_PROVIDER_KIND`"

#: ../../reference/environment-overrides.md
msgid "`local_filesystem`"
msgstr "`local_filesystem`"

#: ../../reference/environment-overrides.md
msgid ""
"Backend for `cadrumo.adapters.outbound.storage`. Accepted values: "
"local_filesystem (default), google_drive, in_memory. google_drive "
"additionally requires cadrumo_google_drive_root_folder_id and a per-"
"profile registered OAuth client + token via `aeat config google`."
msgstr ""
"Backend per a `cadrumo.adapters.outbound.storage`. Valors acceptats: "
"local_filesystem (per defecte), google_drive, in_memory. google_drive "
"requereix a més cadrumo_google_drive_root_folder_id i un client OAuth + "
"testimoni registrat per perfil mitjançant `aeat config google`."

#: ../../reference/environment-overrides.md
msgid "`CADRUMO_STRICT_SECURITY`"
msgstr "`CADRUMO_STRICT_SECURITY`"

#: ../../reference/environment-overrides.md
msgid ""
"Raise instead of warn when AEAT credential artifact permission hardening "
"fails"
msgstr ""
"Llança un error en comptes d'advertir quan falla l'enduriment de permisos"
" de l'artefacte de credencials de l'AEAT"

#: ../../reference/environment-overrides.md
msgid "`CADRUMO_SUBMISSIONS_DIR`"
msgstr "`CADRUMO_SUBMISSIONS_DIR`"

#: ../../reference/environment-overrides.md
msgid "Directory where ModeloPresentado JSON audit records are persisted"
msgstr ""
"Directori on es persisteixen els registres d'auditoria JSON de "
"ModeloPresentado"

#: ../../reference/environment-overrides.md
msgid "`CADRUMO_TELEMETRY_ENDPOINT`"
msgstr "`CADRUMO_TELEMETRY_ENDPOINT`"

#: ../../reference/environment-overrides.md
msgid ""
"Remote telemetry collector URL, consumed by HttpTelemetrySink when a call"
" site opts into real transmission. Unset means no dial target."
msgstr ""
"URL del recol·lector de telemetria remota, que consumeix "
"HttpTelemetrySink quan un lloc de crida opta per la transmissió real. "
"Sense definir vol dir que no hi ha cap destinació de marcatge."

#: ../../reference/environment-overrides.md
msgid "`CADRUMO_TELEMETRY_GESTOR_MODE`"
msgstr "`CADRUMO_TELEMETRY_GESTOR_MODE`"

#: ../../reference/environment-overrides.md
msgid ""
"Gestor/professional deployment flag. When True, remote telemetry emission"
" is categorically refused regardless of cadrumo_telemetry_opt_in, "
"cadrumo_telemetry_tier, or per-invocation consent."
msgstr ""
"Indicador de desplegament per a gestor/professional. Quan és True, "
"l'emissió de telemetria remota es refusa categòricament independentment "
"de cadrumo_telemetry_opt_in, cadrumo_telemetry_tier o del consentiment "
"per invocació."

#: ../../reference/environment-overrides.md
msgid "`CADRUMO_TELEMETRY_OPT_IN`"
msgstr "`CADRUMO_TELEMETRY_OPT_IN`"

#: ../../reference/environment-overrides.md
msgid ""
"Whether this deployment permits transmitting remote telemetry at all. "
"Default off: all telemetry stays local. When True, a per-invocation "
"operator consent acknowledgement is still required for each emit, and "
"cadrumo_telemetry_tier must not be 'off'."
msgstr ""
"Si aquest desplegament permet transmetre telemetria remota o no. "
"Desactivat per defecte: tota la telemetria es queda local. Quan és True, "
"encara cal un reconeixement de consentiment de l'operador per invocació "
"per a cada emissió, i cadrumo_telemetry_tier no ha de ser «off»."

#: ../../reference/environment-overrides.md
msgid "`CADRUMO_TELEMETRY_TIER`"
msgstr "`CADRUMO_TELEMETRY_TIER`"

#: ../../reference/environment-overrides.md
msgid "TelemetryTier"
msgstr "TelemetryTier"

#: ../../reference/environment-overrides.md
msgid "`off`"
msgstr "`off`"

#: ../../reference/environment-overrides.md
msgid ""
"Remote telemetry tier: 'off' (no remote emission regardless of opt-in), "
"'crash_only' (error/outcome counters only), or 'full' (counters plus "
"timing percentiles). Only remote_allowed=True metric keys are ever "
"eligible for transmission at any tier."
msgstr ""
"Nivell de telemetria remota: «off» (cap emissió remota independentment de"
" la inclusió), «crash_only» (només comptadors d'error/resultat) o «full» "
"(comptadors més percentils de temps). Només les claus de mètrica amb "
"remote_allowed=True són mai elegibles per a la transmissió en qualsevol "
"nivell."

#: ../../reference/environment-overrides.md
msgid "`CADRUMO_TOKEN_DIR`"
msgstr "`CADRUMO_TOKEN_DIR`"

#: ../../reference/environment-overrides.md
msgid ""
"Directory for cached authentication token and lock files. The "
"``PROJECT_ROOT`` default here is a placeholder: when the field is not "
"explicitly set, the model validator roots it at "
"``<cadrumo_local_storage_root>/tokens`` so every profile store, token and"
" lock files included, lives under one state root. An explicit "
"``CADRUMO_TOKEN_DIR`` override wins over the derived default."
msgstr ""
"Directori per als fitxers de testimoni d'autenticació i de bloqueig en "
"memòria cau. El valor per defecte ``PROJECT_ROOT`` d'aquí és un marcador "
"de posició: quan el camp no s'estableix explícitament, el validador del "
"model l'arrela a ``<cadrumo_local_storage_root>/tokens`` de manera que "
"cada magatzem de perfil, inclosos els fitxers de testimoni i de bloqueig,"
" visqui sota una sola arrel d'estat. Una substitució explícita "
"``CADRUMO_TOKEN_DIR`` preval sobre el valor per defecte derivat."

#: ../../reference/environment-overrides.md
#, fuzzy
msgid "`CADRUMO_TUI_APPEARANCE`"
msgstr "`CADRUMO_OUTPUT_LANGUAGE`"

#: ../../reference/environment-overrides.md
msgid "TuiAppearance"
msgstr ""

#: ../../reference/environment-overrides.md
msgid ""
"Appearance for the full-screen terminal surfaces. auto = follow the host "
"terminal. light = the warm-paper appearance. dark = the low-light "
"appearance."
msgstr ""

#: ../../reference/environment-overrides.md
msgid "`CADRUMO_USAGE_RATIOS_PATH`"
msgstr "`CADRUMO_USAGE_RATIOS_PATH`"

#: ../../reference/environment-overrides.md
msgid "User-configured per-category usage ratio overrides"
msgstr "Substitucions de la proporció d'ús per categoria configurades per l'usuari"

#: ../../reference/environment-overrides.md
msgid "`CADRUMO_VALIDATION_VERDICT_CACHE_DIR`"
msgstr "`CADRUMO_VALIDATION_VERDICT_CACHE_DIR`"

#: ../../reference/environment-overrides.md
msgid ""
"Directory for the persistent registry-validation verdict cache (a "
"fingerprint-keyed proof that validate_registry ran green, so a matching "
"immutable tree skips runtime re-validation)"
msgstr ""
"Directori de la memòria cau persistent de veredictes de validació del "
"registre (una prova indexada per empremta que validate_registry s'ha "
"executat correctament, de manera que un arbre immutable coincident "
"s'estalvia la revalidació en temps d'execució)"

#: ../../reference/environment-overrides.md
msgid "`CADRUMO_WALLET_DIAGNOSTIC_DUMP_DIR`"
msgstr "`CADRUMO_WALLET_DIAGNOSTIC_DUMP_DIR`"

#: ../../reference/environment-overrides.md
msgid ""
"Opt-in diagnostic capture directory for the IVA compensation wallet "
"(cartera) read. The ``None`` default disables capture and is the only "
"production posture: with it unset the wallet read path is byte-for-byte "
"unchanged. When set via ``CADRUMO_WALLET_DIAGNOSTIC_DUMP_DIR`` the read "
"dumps the full captured page tree — main document, every popup page, "
"every child frame, and per-page screenshots — to this directory so AEAT "
"DOM drift on the cartera surface can be diagnosed offline against real "
"evidence. The capture may contain live taxpayer amounts; it is written "
"only to this operator-chosen directory and must never be committed or "
"reused as a fixture without sanitisation."
msgstr ""
"Directori de captura de diagnòstic d'inclusió per a la lectura del "
"moneder de compensació d'IVA (cartera). El valor per defecte ``None`` "
"desactiva la captura i és l'única postura de producció: amb ell sense "
"definir, el camí de lectura del moneder és idèntic byte a byte. Quan "
"s'estableix mitjançant ``CADRUMO_WALLET_DIAGNOSTIC_DUMP_DIR``, la lectura"
" bolca l'arbre complet de pàgines capturades —el document principal, cada"
" pàgina emergent, cada marc fill i captures de pantalla per pàgina— a "
"aquest directori de manera que la desviació del DOM de l'AEAT a la "
"superfície de la cartera es pugui diagnosticar fora de línia contra "
"evidència real. La captura pot contenir imports reals del contribuent; "
"només s'escriu en aquest directori triat per l'operador i mai no s'ha de "
"cometre ni reutilitzar com a fixture sense sanejament."

#: ../../reference/environment-overrides.md
msgid "`CADRUMO_WALLET_DIAGNOSTIC_RETENTION_DAYS`"
msgstr "`CADRUMO_WALLET_DIAGNOSTIC_RETENTION_DAYS`"

#: ../../reference/environment-overrides.md
msgid ""
"Retention window in days for wallet diagnostic dump files; when the opt-"
"in dump directory is configured, dump files older than this are pruned"
msgstr ""
"Finestra de retenció en dies per als fitxers de bolcat de diagnòstic del "
"moneder; quan el directori de bolcat d'inclusió està configurat, els "
"fitxers de bolcat més antics que això s'eliminen"

#: ../../reference/environment-overrides.md
msgid "`CADRUMO_WORKBOOK_PARITY_LIBREOFFICE_TIMEOUT_S`"
msgstr "`CADRUMO_WORKBOOK_PARITY_LIBREOFFICE_TIMEOUT_S`"

#: ../../reference/environment-overrides.md
msgid "`120`"
msgstr "`120`"

#: ../../reference/environment-overrides.md
msgid ""
"Subprocess timeout (seconds) for the LibreOffice binary XLS conversion "
"fall-back"
msgstr ""
"Temps màxim de subprocés (segons) per a la reserva de conversió d'XLS del"
" binari de LibreOffice"

#: ../../reference/environment-overrides.md
msgid "`CADRUMO_WORKBOOK_PARITY_PER_FILE_TIMEOUT_S`"
msgstr "`CADRUMO_WORKBOOK_PARITY_PER_FILE_TIMEOUT_S`"

#: ../../reference/environment-overrides.md
msgid "`15.0`"
msgstr "`15.0`"

#: ../../reference/environment-overrides.md
msgid "Default per-file timeout (seconds) for workbook-parity scans"
msgstr ""
"Temps màxim per fitxer per defecte (segons) per als escanejos de paritat "
"de llibres de treball"

#: ../../reference/environment-overrides.md
msgid "`CADRUMO_WORKBOOK_PARITY_RECALC_TIMEOUT_S`"
msgstr "`CADRUMO_WORKBOOK_PARITY_RECALC_TIMEOUT_S`"

#: ../../reference/environment-overrides.md
msgid "Subprocess timeout (seconds) when forcing workbook recalculation"
msgstr ""
"Temps màxim de subprocés (segons) en forçar el recàlcul del llibre de "
"treball"

#: ../../reference/environment-overrides.md
msgid "`CADRUMO_WORKFLOW_RUNS_DIR`"
msgstr "`CADRUMO_WORKFLOW_RUNS_DIR`"

#: ../../reference/environment-overrides.md
msgid "Directory where WorkflowResult JSON audit records are persisted"
msgstr ""
"Directori on es persisteixen els registres d'auditoria JSON de "
"WorkflowResult"

#: ../../reference/environment-overrides.md
msgid "`FINANCIAL_BASE_CURRENCY`"
msgstr "`FINANCIAL_BASE_CURRENCY`"

#: ../../reference/environment-overrides.md
msgid "`EUR`"
msgstr "`EUR`"

#: ../../reference/environment-overrides.md
msgid ""
"Fallback ISO 4217 currency used when a financial source omits a per-row "
"currency"
msgstr ""
"Moneda ISO 4217 de reserva que s'utilitza quan una font financera omet "
"una moneda per fila"

#: ../../reference/environment-overrides.md
msgid "`FINANCIAL_DEFAULT_CSV_ENCODING`"
msgstr "`FINANCIAL_DEFAULT_CSV_ENCODING`"

#: ../../reference/environment-overrides.md
msgid "`utf-8`"
msgstr "`utf-8`"

#: ../../reference/environment-overrides.md
msgid "Preferred encoding attempted first when decoding financial CSV sources"
msgstr ""
"Codificació preferida que s'intenta primer en descodificar fonts CSV "
"financeres"

#: ../../reference/environment-overrides.md
msgid "`NO_COLOR`"
msgstr "`NO_COLOR`"

#: ../../reference/environment-overrides.md
msgid ""
"Disable ANSI colour output regardless of TTY state. Mirrors the widely-"
"adopted no-color.org convention via the NO_COLOR environment variable; "
"pydantic-settings reads NO_COLOR (uppercased field name) out of "
"os.environ on Settings() instantiation, so the no-color convention is "
"honoured without per-call-site os.environ reads."
msgstr ""
"Desactiva la sortida de color ANSI independentment de l'estat del TTY. "
"Reflecteix la convenció àmpliament adoptada de no-color.org a través de "
"la variable d'entorn NO_COLOR; pydantic-settings llegeix NO_COLOR (nom "
"del camp en majúscules) d'os.environ en la instanciació de Settings(), de"
" manera que la convenció no-color es respecta sense lectures d'os.environ"
" a cada lloc de crida."

